{"id":"wb-1-4","name":"韶山冲毛主席旧居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"韶山冲毛泽东同志故居","text":"韶山冲毛泽东同志故居又称韶山冲毛主席旧居，位于中国湖南省湘潭市韶山市韶山乡韶山村韶山冲上屋场。1893年，毛泽东在此出生。1929年，国民政府将其没收，迄中华人民共和国建立后，1950年方按原貌修复。1961年被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9F%B6%E5%B1%B1%E5%86%B2%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%90%8C%E5%BF%97%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":94060431,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94060431","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/aa00c19b7ad84f477baa15cc.jpg","title":"Ssmaoresi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ssmaoresi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/Ssmaoresi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的Efm","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"mao zedong's residence in shaoshan, xiangtan\n韶山毛泽东故居\n\nphoto by efm","width":800,"height":513}}